6:  * update checker (scripts/check-update.mjs inside the global Archify skill).
7:  *
8:  * Behavior:
9:  *  - Res        pects the same opt-outs the skill itself honors:
10:  *    ARCHIFY_UPDATE_CHECK_DISABLED=1 (skill built-in, checked again below).
11:  *  - Stays silent on "current", "silent", cache-misses, and any network or
12:  *    runtime failure (check-in-progress, cache-unavailable, timeout, ...).
13:  *  - On "update_available": logs a compact notice through the documented
14:  *    client log API and, if update severity is "security", uses the
15:  *    warn level. A JSON evidence file (receipt) is written next to the
16:  *    skill state so the result is machine-checkable.
17:  *
